This Setting is used to enable whatsapp invoice sending. If the value is 0 then considered disabled. To enable this, the template name and variable names to be entered in json should be: {"templatename": "outlet_invoice_send_pdf_header","variables": ["outlet_name", "bill_number", "company_name", "bill_value"],"caption": "Dear {{name}}

Attached here is your sales invoice for bill number {{billNo}}. Your bill value is Rs. {{amount}}. In case of any query, please reach out to our sales team.

Team {{companyName}}"} Note - This template MUST BE ENTERED AS GIVEN ABOVE || Beta Version : {"templatename":"sales_invoice_generation","variables":["invoice_number","invoice_date","amount","quantity","company_name"],"caption":"Dear Customer, Invoice No. {{invoice_number}} DT: {{invoice_date}} of Rs.{{amount}} and Qty Ltr.{{quantity}} is generated. Rgds, Distributor {{company_name}} - {{company_name}}"} ||

This is temporary json setting to set values in businesstype, warehousecategories,warehousetypes,outlettypes,outletcategories dropdown. you have to set the comma sperated id insde the []. for example you want that only 1,2 businesstype should visible in the app for role id distributor salesman then under rolewise setting you can set value as {
  "businesstype": {"id": [1,2]},
  "warehousecategories":{"id":[]},
  "warehousetypes":{"id":[]},
  "outlettypes":{"id":[]},
  "outletcategories":{"id":[]}
}

This Setting is used to enable whatsapp notifaction to welcome new outlet in the company. If the value is 0 then considered disabled. To enable this, the  template name and variable names to be entered in json like
    {
      "templatename": "outlet_onbording_template",
      "variables": [
        "company_name"
      ],
      "caption": "Dear Customer, Welcome to {{company_name}}. You are now subscribed to receive Promotional & Transactional messages."
    }

