This setting is used to configure login OTP messages in multiple languages for two-factor authentication. With this setting, you can specify different messages for web
    and app users, as well as different messages for various language portals. NOTE: This setting is dependent on setting twofactorauth. All
    the mentioned sms template should be vendor compliant. example to set the setting values
    {
      "web": {
        "en": "SHELL - Your OTP authentication code at Bizom Website https://vnshell.bizom.in/ is _code_",
        "vi": "SHELL - ma OTP cua ban tai website https://vnshell.bizom.in/ la _code_"
      },
      "mobile": {
        "en": "SHELL - Your OTP authentication code at Bizom App is _code_",
        "vi": "SHELL - ma OTP cua ban tai app Bizom la _code_"
      }
    }
